IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-AQLM-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NUM-CODEBOOKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 RESIDUAL-ERROR-X10K PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-AQLM-V2.
    IF DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF NUM-CODEBOOKS == 0
        MOVE 4 TO NUM-CODEBOOKS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9 TO RESIDUAL-ERROR-X10K.
    MOVE 9100 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CODEBOOKS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
